port, show retry/reconnect; do not assume cluster-wide outage. |\n| WebSocket (MARATHON-20) | Connection on dead node drops; resume/subscribe against a live node is that task’s problem. Restart only restores a peer process. |\n| Cross-node fan-out (MARATHON-22) | May see a peer gap until respawn; must not require this task to change pub/sub code. |\n\nPayload shapes crossing the FE/BE JSON seam are **unchanged** by this task.\n","localExecutionTimeMs":67},"isBackground":false},"description":"Git history and task comments"},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-52ea18d7-705c-4f59-83cc-6706705083ea-5\nfc_cdd28b7f-4b12-9e7f-9973-3017f0247761_2","startedAtMs":"1787424980155","completedAtMs":"1787424980279"},"model_call_id":"e1004229-730f-4840-966d-b932d594bc6c-1-366j","session_id":"49ffb699-fd37-4b50-96be-46bad2e3f892","timestamp_ms":1787424980306}
